  "limitations": [
    "The complete P0/P1 replay adapter is not a production entry point. Future P0 inference/publication must be independent of profit, verification and statistics; missing P1 must not block a valid promotion list.",
    "No model is deserialized, trained, or run by forward.engine. Frozen P0/P1 outputs are only verified and copied.",
    "P0 feature production still depends on legacy auction_v3 engine path features, d_close_features and three_engine_models; this is not yet an independent runtime.",
    "P1 production still depends on legacy executable_profit_shadow feature assembly and strict lagged priors, plus the frozen research contract.",
    "Path labels are rule/feature diagnostics from auction_v3.engine._streak_path_features, not a separately trained model.",
    "Preprocessing, missingness handling, feature order and calibration remain in retained artifacts/source; unpickled internals have not been re-audited by this adapter.",
    "Retained legacy weights are not automatically eligible for new primary ranking. Newly studied loss-making candidates remain NO_RELEASE.",
    "Historical feature inputs are retained, but old selections, validation outcomes and cumulative totals are never imported into the new ledger.",
    "Hashes document archive assets and allow active model verification; they do not attest current GitHub HEAD, live schedule execution, or independently reproduced model scores."
